%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ed70aee8cc8cd4f8ca7ec0b6c7dc5db3, type: 3}
  m_Name: RooftopInventoryDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Northbound.Runtime::Northbound.Dialogue.DialogueAsset
  id: rooftop_inventory_dialogue
  lines:
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: The north has real opportunities. Staying here means letting this city decide for us.
    textChinese: 北边有真正的机会。留在这里，就等于让这座城市替我们决定人生。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Leo
    text: The distance might not be better. We have put every hope we have into a place we cannot even see.
    textChinese: 远方未必更好。我们只是把所有希望，都寄托在一个根本看不见的地方。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: Then tell us, Jamie. What are we supposed to choose?
    textChinese: 那你来说，杰米。我们到底该怎么选？
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices:
    - text: The north is our only way forward. We have to keep the plan.
      textChinese: 北边是唯一的出路，我们必须坚持原来的计划。
      grantedFact: choice_ch1_rooftop_northbound
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 10
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: -10
      nextLineIndex: 3
    - text: We can leave without cutting every tie to this place.
      textChinese: 我们可以去远方，但不用彻底斩断和这里的联结。
      grantedFact: choice_ch1_rooftop_balance
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: 3
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 3
      nextLineIndex: 5
    - text: What we have here matters more to me than an imagined north.
      textChinese: 比起想象中的北方，我更珍惜眼前熟悉的一切。
      grantedFact: choice_ch1_rooftop_home
      counterDeltas:
      - id: tendency_commitment
        amount: -10
      - id: tendency_agency
        amount: 10
      nextLineIndex: 6
  - speakerId: Elias
    text: If we stay together, we can be on the road before the week is over.
    textChinese: 只要我们齐心协力，这周结束以前就能上路。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 4
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: Leo walks to the roof edge and watches the old street instead of the northern lights.
    textChinese: 利奥独自走到屋顶边缘。他看着脚下的老街，没有看北边的灯。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: Neither of them wins the argument. For a moment, that feels honest.
    textChinese: 谁也没有说服谁。可至少这一刻，所有人都很诚实。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Leo
    text: I thought I was the only one who could admit I might miss this place.
    textChinese: 我还以为，只有我敢承认自己可能会想念这里。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: Elias folds the route map once, then again, until the north disappears inside it.
    textChinese: 伊莱亚斯把路线图折了一次，又折了一次，直到北方消失在纸页里面。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    choices: []
  - speakerId: Maya
    text: Four days left. That is still enough time for the plan to become a choice.
    textChinese: 还剩四天。足够让一个计划，重新变成一次真正的选择。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
  - speakerId:
    text: The three of you look north. Below, Greybridge keeps every light it can afford.
    textChinese: 你们三个人望向北方。脚下的格雷布里奇，守着它还能点亮的每一盏灯。
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    reactionClip: {fileID: 0}
    requiredFact:
    grantedFact:
    counterDeltas: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    choices: []
